    'CSAT, NPS and FCR all come from the same customer survey. 12,444.65 surveys were returned against 30,681 calls, a 40.6% return rate. The dashboard shows nothing about the 59.4% who did not answer.',
    'Team, week and tenure figures default to the unweighted mean of agent-week rates, exactly as the workbook computes them: an agent with 20 surveys counts the same as an agent with 300. The Averaging control switches to weighting by surveys or calls, which moves overall CSAT from 78.98% to 79.35%.',
